[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2735265699","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104339#issuecomment-2735265699","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104339","id":2735265699,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jCNej","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T04:03:32Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T04:03:32Z","body":"Did you try to just  move `add_theme_style_override()` to `NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED`?\r\n(Note that I view changes from tablet so can miss something).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2735265699/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2735393456","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104339#issuecomment-2735393456","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104339","id":2735393456,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jCsqw","user":{"login":"Grublady","id":29121925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTIxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29121925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady","html_url":"https://github.com/Grublady","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T05:37:58Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T05:37:58Z","body":"> Did you try to just  move `add_theme_style_override()` to `NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED`?\n\nYes I did try this--\n\nUnfortunately, `add_theme_style_override` calls `_notify_theme_override_changed`, which sends a new `NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED`.\n\nThus it starts the whole thing over again and creates an endless cyclical call loop that runs until available memory is exhausted.\n\nThe solution that is implemented is based on `EditorProperty::_update_property_bg`, which mitigates this issue by connecting to the parent's notification instead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2735393456/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2735437183","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104339#issuecomment-2735437183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104339","id":2735437183,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jC3V_","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T06:09:40Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T06:27:18Z","body":"Oh, actually you call `add_theme_style_override()` for inspector node, right... Makes sence.\r\nI looked at how it is done in other places and seems like current implementation (connecting to parent signal) is the way to go.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2735437183/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777105184","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104339#issuecomment-2777105184","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104339","id":2777105184,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lh0Mg","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T22:10:37Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T22:10:37Z","body":"This causes `NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED` to be received twice by each inspector.\r\nYou could guard against it:\r\n```C++\r\nvoid EditorInspector::_update_theme() {\r\n\tupdating_theme = true;\r\n\tadd_theme_style_override(SceneStringName(panel), get_theme_stylebox(SceneStringName(panel), SNAME(\"Tree\")));\r\n\tupdating_theme = false;\r\n}\r\n```\r\nAnd do a `break`/`return` in NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED when updating theme.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777105184/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784855690","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104339#issuecomment-2784855690","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104339","id":2784855690,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l_YaK","user":{"login":"Grublady","id":29121925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTIxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29121925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady","html_url":"https://github.com/Grublady","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T23:29:58Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T23:29:58Z","body":"> This causes NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED to be received twice by each inspector.\r\n\r\nNow updated to avoid this by connecting in `ready` instead of `enter_tree`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784855690/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784859402","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104339#issuecomment-2784859402","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104339","id":2784859402,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l_ZUK","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T23:33:04Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T23:33:04Z","body":"The inspector will receive `NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED` after parent and then after `add_theme_style_override()`. Changing when the signal is connected doesn't affect it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784859402/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784892601","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104339#issuecomment-2784892601","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104339","id":2784892601,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l_ha5","user":{"login":"Grublady","id":29121925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTIxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29121925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady","html_url":"https://github.com/Grublady","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api